# skillo publish governance (who may change which skills)
# GitHub CODEOWNERS: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-a-repository/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Repo permission model (RBAC):
#   Read   -> can consume (skillo setup / sync)
#   Write  -> can publish (gated by the rules below)
#   Admin  -> manages people, branches and these rules
#
# Default: every change requires review from the library admins:
*                                                       @YOUR-ORG/skillo-admins

# Team-scoped folders: owners of a topic may publish their own skills without
# blocking on the central admins (changes still require one approval):
# /skills/team-acme/                                    @YOUR-ORG/team-acme-maintainers
# /agents/                                              @YOUR-ORG/agent-reviewers
